  (text "01_Battery_Protection" (at 15.24 22 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bdce35fb-3e45-56a6-802b-712b7afc1ce1"))
  (text "BATTERY PROTECTION CHAIN\nPACK -> BMS -> main fuse -> main disconnect -> reverse-polarity block -> shunt -> VBATT_MAIN\nReturn path: GND_PWR is the power star point. Net tie to GND_LOGIC is on sheet 02." (at 15.24 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9bbd46c0-f8fa-5460-a014-4453fde1c334"))
  (text "NOTES\n1. Precharge for VMOT bulk capacitance required if drive input caps are large (see sheet 05/09).\n2. Fuse/TVS/shunt values depend on peak current (sheet docs/Power_Budget).\n3. ALERT output goes to STM32 PM_ALERT input." (at 114.22 112.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2ad84773-85c8-52c6-b9cb-e3eba1e45936"))
